Logs possible lag-switch incidents to the server RPT. Load it on the server: it starts automatically in every mission without a module or CBA and sends the heartbeat script to connected and joining clients. Clients send a heartbeat every second. If a player's heartbeat stops for more than 3 seconds and they kill a player or AI unit while lagging or within 10 seconds after reconnecting, the server logs the kill for review. When many clients fall silent together, the server suppresses new flags for that interval. The check tracks the connection through respawn and slot changes. Review the log alongside other evidence before treating an incident as cheating.

[url=https://github.com/Dschitarre/a3-dev/tree/master/src/mods/lagswitchdetection]Source code[/url]
